# =============================================================
# FeelFX - Environment configuration (OPTIONAL)
# =============================================================
#
# Copy this file to .env.local and fill in values ONLY if you
# want the optional Google Drive / YouTube export integrations.
#
#   cp .env.example .env.local
#
# FeelFX works perfectly with NO configuration at all.
# The core pipeline (local AI analysis -> DSL -> Three.js/GSAP)
# never touches Google. All Google-related code is isolated in
# src/integrations/ and stays inactive without a Client ID.
#
# NEVER commit .env.local or real credentials to git.
# =============================================================

# -------------------------------------------------------------
# Google OAuth Client ID (OPTIONAL)
#
# Enables the "Export & Publish" panel:
#   [ Save to Google Drive ]
#   [ Upload to YouTube ]
#
# How to get one:
#   1. Go to https://console.cloud.google.com/
#   2. Create (or select) a project
#   3. APIs & Services -> Library:
#        - Enable "Google Drive API"
#        - Enable "YouTube Data API v3"
#   4. APIs & Services -> OAuth consent screen:
#        - Choose "External"
#        - Add the scopes:
#            .../auth/drive.file
#            .../auth/youtube.upload
#        - Add yourself as a test user (while in Testing mode)
#   5. APIs & Services -> Credentials -> Create credentials ->
#      OAuth client ID -> Application type: "Web application"
#        - Add "Authorized JavaScript origins":
#            http://localhost:5173   (Vite dev server)
#            http://localhost:4173   (vite preview)
#            plus your production origin if deployed
#        - No redirect URI is needed (implicit token flow)
#   6. Copy the Client ID (it looks like
#      1234567890-abc123.apps.googleusercontent.com)
#
# This is a PUBLIC Client ID - safe for browser SPAs.
# Never put a client SECRET in this file; browsers cannot
# keep secrets.
# -------------------------------------------------------------

# VITE_GOOGLE_CLIENT_ID=387882361436-rc3m99gfsfet0m5tamlimkft1cmsrs73.apps.googleusercontent.com
